#: 6af88afd1158441798642bee5513199a
msgid "Isaac Scenes and USD"
msgstr "Isaac 场景与 USD"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:3
#: 6528621a31a544a4a9b633857486e2a3
msgid ""
"Synthetic datagen in this stack is an **Isaac Sim** line. Gazebo is not "
"part of this pipeline."
msgstr "本栈的合成数据采集是 **Isaac Sim** 线路。Gazebo 不在这条流水线里。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:5
#: b0d8c9d0cfd94c1b8282b1c6ee8fb22e
msgid ""
"Scene assets live in **FaSim-Isaac**. Robot USD files are the "
"**robot_usds** superproject (FaSim submodule `robots/`). Environment and "
"private project USDs sit beside that tree, not inside it."
msgstr ""
"场景资产在 **FaSim-Isaac**。机器人 USD 是 **robot_usds** 超级仓库（FaSim 子模块 "
"`robots/`）。环境与私有项目 USD 与这棵树并列，不在它内部。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:7
#: 557abe7df66c434fb188fccf1860cce7
msgid "FaSim-Isaac (scene host)"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac（场景宿主）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:9
#: 1e2f149064ac4dd6bee614156d194def
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac)"
msgstr ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:11
#: 53c63b2d77354fcdaaa463d750ec5eb8
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac is the one-click Isaac asset workspace: it clones USD "
"submodules, can install the Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay, and starts Sim. "
"Prefer the scripts; do not hand-assemble the tree."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 是一键 Isaac 资产工作区：克隆 USD 子模块、可安装 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay、并启动 "
"Sim。优先用脚本，不要手拼目录树。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:13
#: 51a6d78387fe4ab1be12f7fbc998e640
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:20
#: 0b7e4100e4d24c1a8c228ed3a849f0a4
msgid ""
"`./init.sh` menu and `./run.sh` flags: [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md). Operation 1 selects submodules "
"(`public` checked, private unchecked until you have access). Operation 4 "
"is the optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay. The version menu queries "
"GitHub stable tags; `config/fa_sim.conf` falls back to `6.2.0` / `6.1.0` "
"/ `6.0.1`. Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`. Operation 5 "
"installs `fasim.ros2.nodes` (needed before Play on an in-process "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` graph)."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh` 菜单和 `./run.sh` 参数见 [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。第 1 项选择子模块（`public` "
"默认勾选，私有项在有权限前不勾）。第 4 项是可选的 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 叠加层。版本菜单向 GitHub "
"查询稳定标签；`config/fa_sim.conf` 回退到 `6.2.0` / `6.1.0` / `6.0.1`。可用 "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。第 5 项安装 `fasim.ros2.nodes`（进程内 "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` 图在播放前需要它）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:22
#: a4530d4a570449e7a44be06161026531
msgid ""
"The datagen example README "
"([`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md) on `main`) still "
"lists Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy, and Isaac Sim 6.0. Keep path and version"
" in FaSim config. The FaSim fallback list above is newer than that 6.0 "
"line."
msgstr ""
"数采示例 README（`main` 上的 [`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md)）仍写 "
"Ubuntu 24.04、ROS 2 Jazzy 和 Isaac Sim 6.0。路径和版本以 FaSim 配置为准。上面的 FaSim "
"回退列表比那一行 6.0 更新。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:24
#: 9dd542c38ef040749b2c1cc5fc43b158
msgid "Layout from that README:"
msgstr "该 README 中的布局："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:26
#: 9c72f3e966c64dcaa5d5664a25108b50
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── config/                 # fa_sim.conf + optional fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── robots/                 # → robot_usds\n"
"├── environment/\n"
"│   ├── fiveages_env/       # → fiveages-env-usds (public scenes)\n"
"│   └── fa-project-usd/     # → fa-project-usd (private project USD)\n"
"└── isaac_jazzy_ws/         # created by init.sh operation 4"
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── config/                 # fa_sim.conf + optional fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── robots/                 # → robot_usds\n"
"├── environment/\n"
"│   ├── fiveages_env/       # → fiveages-env-usds (public scenes)\n"
"│   └── fa-project-usd/     # → fa-project-usd (private project USD)\n"
"└── isaac_jazzy_ws/         # created by init.sh operation 4"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:38
#: f70bc5b9a9ff4c249c91c01198bdb8d6
msgid ""
"Open the target robot USD from `robots/` (robot_usds) in Isaac and run "
"the simulation. Enable Isaac’s ROS 2 simulation-control and prim services"
" as in the [NVIDIA Isaac ROS 2 workspace "
"docs](https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_ros.html"
"#setup-ros-2-workspaces) linked from the example README "
"(`/set_simulation_state`, prim service for object pose)."
msgstr ""
"在 Isaac 中打开 `robots/`（robot_usds）里目标机器人 USD 并运行仿真。按示例 README 所链的 [NVIDIA "
"Isaac ROS 2 workspace "
"文档](https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_ros.html"
"#setup-ros-2-workspaces) 启用 ROS 2 simulation-control 与 prim "
"服务（`/set_simulation_state`、物体位姿 prim service）。"

