#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/1-isaac_scenes.md:69
#: 003f8396fd404e63b4bccdbe1f6be6fa
msgid ""
"FaSim `submodules_visibility.conf` marks Galbot public and the FiveAges "
"and Ubtech trees private, so `./init.sh` does not select FiveAges by "
"default. The Gen1 remote (`fiveages-gen1-robot-usds`) and the Gen2 remote"
" (`fiveages-gen2-robot-usds`) are public. W2R and S2R are not in the Gen2"
" USD repo. robot_usds also keeps grippers, dexterous hands, manipulators,"
" mobile bases, mobile manipulators, and sensors in the tree itself. "
"Browse the repo for the current roots."
msgstr ""
"FaSim 的 `submodules_visibility.conf` 把 Galbot 标成公开，把第五纪和优必选的树标成私有，所以 "
"`./init.sh` 默认不选第五纪。Gen1 远端（`fiveages-gen1-robot-usds`）和 Gen2 远端"
